<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT SOUTH AFRICA BY 15 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT SOUTH AFRICA BY 15 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN, South Africa 1997-04-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat South Africa by 15 runs in the fourth one-day international on Saturday.</p>
<p>Australia levelled the seven-match series at 2-2.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 211-9 (50 overs). South Africa 196 (48.1 overs).</p>
</text>
